      "id": "claim_b9177ef006984bc18f58ce2ba84481e5",
      "statement": "A tool call crosses four owned layers exactly once: the MCP server (mcp-server.ts) builds envelopes, the WebSocket relay (servers/websocket/src/server.ts) authenticates and forwards by request ID, the extension background controller (packages/shared/src/background-controller.ts) dispatches by payload type, and shared page-reader.ts performs browser-agnostic active-tab work.",
