      "id": "claim_adfd550ce0aa4b70b4c0c67bef936809",
      "statement": "MCP tool wrappers accept an optional per-call tabId included in the envelope target; requestBrijio only adds a target block when browserInstanceId or tabId is present. The shared page-reader helpers prefer the provided numeric tabId over the active-tab lookup, falling back to tabs.query active/currentWindow when omitted. The controller extracts tabId once via extractTabId and threads it into read/action/batch/navigation handlers.",
