      "statement": "open_tab(url) flows MCP -> relay -> extension pageOpenTab adapter -> tabs.create({url}) -> open_tab_response with the new tabId, url, and title. The open_tab tool validates HTTP/HTTPS, does not accept tabId (it creates a tab), and the returned raw browser tab ID (as string) lets subsequent tools target the new tab; no close/ownership tracking exists yet.",
