      "id": "claim_e4883754b2dd498c9615ccf241cd5656",
      "statement": "capture_screenshot flows MCP -> relay -> extension pageScreenshot adapter -> tabs.captureVisibleTab({format:'jpeg',quality:80}) -> screenshot_response with base64, dimensions, tabId, capturedAt. It is active-tab/viewport-only for P3.3; the MCP server returns an image content block plus a metadata text block, and isError on failure. Both Chrome and Safari adapters strip the data:image/jpeg;base64 prefix and return width/height as 0 at capture time.",
